{%- comment -%}
  Resolve an image source that may be either:
   - a bare theme-asset filename (e.g. "lp-li-2-hero.jpg")  -> asset_url
   - a full URL (e.g. a Shopify Files CDN url)              -> used as-is
  Landing-page images were migrated out of /assets to Shopify Files to keep the
  theme under Shopify's 50MB GitHub-import cap, so settings now hold full URLs.
  Usage: {%- render 'img-src', src: section.settings.image_asset -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign resolved_src = src | default: ''
  if resolved_src contains '://'
    echo resolved_src
  else
    echo resolved_src | asset_url
  endif
-%}
